# Service catalog: the ONE place where a service is defined. Read by lib/core/catalog.sh when it is sourced.
# One service per line, 13 fields separated by "|" (no spaces around the bars; lists are separated by spaces):
#   key | name | default image | internal port | host-port offset | env template | required variables | Mongo URI variables |
#   soft dependencies | default memory limit | data folders | files of secrets/ it references | secrets generated by --generate-secrets
# Generated secrets are VAR:kind. Kinds: shared (hex 32, the same value in every service of the instance), hex32, hex24, b64-32.
# The description of each service is the message catalog.desc.<key> of lib/i18n.
# To add a service: one line here, its compose file and template (docs/services-catalog.md).
s0|auth-backend|auth-backend|3200|0|.env.s0.example|IP_SERVER JWT_SECRET MONGO_URI IP_INTERNAL_CONNECTION|MONGO_URI||512m|media/user media/loginSettings media/file media/certificate-settings backups||JWT_SECRET:shared
s1|gueo-back-end|gueo-back-end|3000|1|.env.s1.example|IP_SERVER AUTH_URL JWT_SECRET FEDERATION_ENCRYPTION_KEY SERVERS_CONFIG MONGO_DELTA_DISPATCH_URI MONGO_AUTHSOFTWARE_URI MONGO_ROBIN_URI FCM_CERT KEEPER_FCM_CERT DEEPGRAM_API_KEY|MONGO_DELTA_DISPATCH_URI MONGO_AUTHSOFTWARE_URI MONGO_ROBIN_URI|s0|2g|media uploads fileIncidentsResolved imageIncidentsResolved|FCM_CERT KEEPER_FCM_CERT|JWT_SECRET:shared FEDERATION_ENCRYPTION_KEY:b64-32 DELTA_UNIVERSITY_HANDOFF_SECRET:hex32 SHIFT_UPDATE_BASELINE_SECRET:hex24
